cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the article in 'preferred-citation'."
title: "KLTsup: supervised muscle fascicle tracking"
abstract: >-
  Open-source MATLAB implementation of the KLTsup method: automatic optical-flow
  (KLT) fascicle tracking in B-mode ultrasound with FFT/Hough image enhancement
  and a supervision module, plus manual tracking, validation and method
  comparison.
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Carbonacho/KLTsup"
